From b3fbaa574e04578f8859b93d5b29e10fefa89492 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:26:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] T3: every recursion layer keyed with every AIR required

frozen::keygen_checked keys the leaf aggregation, internal (N1, N2, N3), L and
L_Fr sets with every AIR required (keygen_required, as upstream
continuations::prover::keygen_all_required); only the app set keeps optional
AIRs. G1 refuses an optional AIR in a required set (G1Error::Optional).
keygen_any at test parameters and the e4 profile key with required AIRs.

The L_Fr tape generator refuses a shape that leaves out a required AIR
(ShapeError::RequiredAbsent) or has another AIR count than the L key.

fp8_keyset: check_layout asserts no optional AIR; new omit mode, the
omitted-AIR negatives on real proofs (KeyBind, ProofShapeAir,
PublicValuesAir left out of N1, N3 and L: prover path, stock verifier, the
parent or the L_Fr tape) with an optional-key control and the parent
proof-shape constraint count.
